  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Epinion - Infotrak Reasearch and Consulting Ltd. is a project between the partners Epinion A/S and Infotrak Research. The primary objective is to build a company in Subsaharan Africa that delivers CATI (phone interviews), CAPI (computer assisted F2F interviews) and CAWI (online interviews) data which is called a &apos;sample only&apos; company meaning that the company is a data supplier to local and international research companies.</narrative>
